      "text": "THIS CONTEMPT OF COURT CASE (CIVIL) HAVING BEEN FINALLY HEARD ON 11.12.2024, THE COURT ON THE SAME DAY DELIVERED THE FOLLOWING:\n Con.Case (C) No.1497 of 2024  LCo Reji Cherian vs T.N. Vijayan on 11 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/48264708/\n1  2024:KER:93921  -2-  JUDGMENT (Dated this the 11th day of December, 2024) The learned Government Pleader has filed a memo producing copy of the supplementary award passed in terms of the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013 in compliance with the direction of this Court in Annexure-A1 judgment.",
